# Altium-only rules; shared OS/editor/backup rules live at the repository root.
# Patterns apply to projects and libraries at every depth in this directory.
# Keep design documents, project/variant settings, OutJobs, templates, scripts,
# SchLib/PcbLib/IntLib/CmpLib, DbLib/SVNDbLib/DbLink, and their database sources.
# Keep XLS/XLSX/XLSM/XLSB/ODS/CSV workbooks and Access/SQLite databases.

# Local history, recovery, previews, and per-user desktop state.
[Hh][Ii][Ss][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]/
__[Pp][Rr][Ee][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww][Ss]/
*.[Dd][Ee][Ss][Kk][Tt][Oo][Pp]
*.[Ss][Cc][Hh][Dd][Oo][Cc][Pp][Rr][Ee][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]
*.[Pp][Cc][Bb][Dd][Oo][Cc][Pp][Rr][Ee][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]
*.[Pp][Rr][Jj][Pp][Cc][Bb][Ss][Tt][Rr][Uu][Cc][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]
*.[Ss][Cc][Hh][Dd][Oo][Cc]~*
*.[Pp][Cc][Bb][Dd][Oo][Cc]~*
*.[Ss][Cc][Hh][Ll][Ii][Bb]~*
*.[Pp][Cc][Bb][Ll][Ii][Bb]~*
*.[Pp][Rr][Jj][Pp][Cc][Bb]~*

# Default generated logs and output directories (including library compilation).
# Store curated fabrication/release files outside these folders to track them.
# Do not ignore Gerber, drill, BOM, STEP, PDF, or IntLib extensions globally.
[Pp][Rr][Oo][Jj][Ee][Cc][Tt] [Ll][Oo][Gg][Ss]*/
[Pp][Rr][Oo][Jj][Ee][Cc][Tt] [Oo][Uu][Tt][Pp][Uu][Tt][Ss]*/
[Ll][Ii][Bb][Rr][Aa][Rr][Yy] [Pp][Aa][Cc][Kk][Aa][Gg][Ee][Ss]/
[Dd][Ee][Bb][Uu][Gg].[Ll][Oo][Gg]
[Ss][Tt][Aa][Tt][Uu][Ss] [Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt].[Tt][Xx][Tt]
*.[Pp][Cc][Bb][Dd][Oo][Cc].[Hh][Tt][Mm]

# Altium/LibreOffice locks and Microsoft Office owner files.
.~lock.*
~$*

# Access lock files; keep the corresponding MDB/ACCDB database itself.
*.[Ll][Dd][Bb]
*.[Ll][Aa][Cc][Cc][Dd][Bb]
# SQLite journals/WAL files are deliberately not ignored: they can hold data
# needed by the database. Close/checkpoint the database before committing it.
